analysisWe need to read the code. The method add(Edge edge) adds an edge to the path. Implementation:

```
public void add(Edge edge) {
    if (nodePath.isEmpty()) {
        add(null, edge);
    } else {
        add(nodePath.peek(), edge);
    }
    // @@@ If the edge is null, then the last element in the path is null; if the edge is not null, then the last element in the path is the added edge.
}
```

We need to produce an assert statement reflecting the comment.

